/T (As we celebrate this significant milestone, we reaffirm our commitment to academic and professional excellence. This achievement not only reflects the individual capabilities of our faculty but also the shared vision and values of our department. Let us continue to uphold this standard of excellence, pushing the boundaries of knowledge and nurturing the leaders and innovators of tomorrow.)
